   "body": "**PO decisions, 2026-11-08**, binding for this lot:\n- **D1**: `L1` has three answers: the two scenarios plus \"Garder les pages comme aujourd'hui\".\n- **D2**: the optional pseudo (`I1`) is asked at the end, just before submitting.\n\nAlso follow `docs/ux/questionnaire/cadrage-construction.md`: question IDs (§2) and the block format of `questions.md` (§3.2).\n\n---\n_Posted with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code) for the PO (Bruno)._\n",
